.TH KEY_PRESSED 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
key_pressed \- True only on the frame the key went down
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqinput.h\(dq
.BI "bool key_pressed(const Input *in, Key k);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True only on the frame the key went down. Use for one\-shot reactions (open a menu, jump).
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/input.h)
